3.1 Visual identity
GuruFlow should have a distinctive, modern, premium, trustworthy educational technology identity.
Design references in terms of quality:
Linear: clean hierarchy and refined interaction patterns.
Notion: clarity and information organisation.
Apple: spacing, consistency and visual refinement.
Modern banking apps: trustworthy cards, financial clarity and polished details.
Premium productivity apps: simple navigation and excellent usability.
Do not directly copy another application's UI.
Create an original GuruFlow design language.
3.2 Colour system
Use a restrained premium palette.
Suggested direction:
Primary: deep indigo / midnight blue.
Secondary: refined violet or blue-violet.
Accent: soft sky blue.
Success: restrained green.
Warning: warm amber.
