5. FOUR USER ROLES
GuruFlow has four major roles.
ROLE 1 — INSTITUTE OWNER / ADMIN
The owner manages the institute, staff, students, admissions, academics, fees, reports, and permissions.
ROLE 2 — TEACHER
The teacher manages assigned classes, attendance, homework, student progress, exams, doubts, and classroom activities.
ROLE 3 — STUDENT
The student accesses their timetable, attendance, homework, tests, learning resources, progress, and teacher communication.
ROLE 4 — PARENT / GUARDIAN
The parent monitors their verified child's academic progress, attendance, homework, fees, notices, and communication with teachers.
Each role must have a separate, purpose-built experience.
Do not show every role the same dashboard with different labels.
